     Visitors to the Digital Semiconductor booth can request and 
receive special Alpha posters, printed in color using Vivid Image's 
Alpha-based ImageBox high-speed color printer controller.

     Digital Semiconductor, a Digital Equipment Corporation business 
headquartered in Hudson, Massachusetts, designs, manufactures and 
